 our dedicated sustainability website here:...', 'position': '4', 'datecreated': '2024-01-16T08:00:09.000Z', 'datepublished': '2024-01-16T08:00:09.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1747166838008537354'}, {'identifier': '1744992502669549648', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': "During the winter, your fuel is at risk of contamination due to the cold temperatures and wet weather. We're on hand to help manage your fuel supply in the coming months to ensure there’s...", 'position': '5', 'datecreated': '2024-01-10T08:00:07.000Z', 'datepublished': '2024-01-10T08:00:07.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1744992502669549648'}, {'identifier': '1742818176826503374', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Our experts are on hand to help you transition away from fossil fuels in 2024. HVO fuel is a fully renewable diesel alternative that reduces net CO2 emissions by up to 90%. Call 📞0330 123...', 'position': '6', 'datecreated': '2024-01-04T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2024-01-04T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1742818176826503374'}, {'identifier': '1741731045169398004', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'We hope you enjoyed a fantastic end to 2023 and wish all our followers a Happy New Year! 🎉🥂 We look forward to seeing what 2024 has in store for us!', 'position': '7', 'datecreated': '2024-01-01T08:00:15.000Z', 'datepublished': '2024-01-01T08:00:15.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1741731045169398004'}, {'identifier': '1739194313198674029', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'We wish all our followers a Merry Christmas and hope you have an amazing end to 2023! 🎅🎄', 'position': '8', 'datecreated': '2023-12-25T08:00:11.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-12-25T08:00:11.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1739194313198674029'}, {'identifier': '1737019974554685742', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'We had our Speedy Fuels Christmas Jumper Day to raise money for our local hospice. We’re incredibly proud of our team who managed to raise a whopping £190!', 'position': '9', 'datecreated': '2023-12-19T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-12-19T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1737019974554685742'}, {'identifier': '1734845661789434222', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'At Speedy Fuels, our experts can manage and maintain your fuel supply to prevent unwanted disruption to your business this winter. Call ☎️0330 123 3773 to see how we can help your business...', 'position': '10', 'datecreated': '2023-12-13T08:00:12.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-12-13T08:00:12.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1734845661789434222'}, {'identifier': '1732671320565875127', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Need a top up of heating oil this winter? Choose a local supplier that you can rely on, no matter the weather. Order your fuel today: https://bit.ly/2QISRF8', 'position': '11', 'datecreated': '2023-12-07T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-12-07T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1732671320565875127'}, {'identifier': '1731946558701080679', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Not all diesel is made the same! If you use the wrong grade diesel during the winter, you run the risk of corroding your tank and unplanned downtime. Learn more: https://bit.ly/3Np1oJS', 'position': '12', 'datecreated': '2023-12-05T08:00:12.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-12-05T08:00:12.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1731946558701080679'}, {'identifier': '1730134605527732613', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'If your storage tanks are running low over the winter, our emergency fuel service can put your mind at ease. We can deliver emergency fuel nationwide within 24 hours, 365 days a year! Call...', 'position': '13', 'datecreated': '2023-11-30T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-30T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1730134605527732613'}, {'identifier': '1729409828517298295', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Demand for fuel grows significantly over the winter months and as a result we’re over 50% busier. That’s why it’s important to book your winter delivery early to guarantee your fuel supply....', 'position': '14', 'datecreated': '2023-11-28T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-28T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1729409828517298295'}, {'identifier': '1727597901260468484', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Never run out of fuel again with our tank telemetry monitoring systems! The sensors provide instant alerts when fuel levels drop, helping you to ensure that your tanks have adequate contents...', 'position': '15', 'datecreated': '2023-11-23T08:00:11.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-23T08:00:11.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1727597901260468484'}, {'identifier': '1726873118424142179', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'If your fuel is running short this winter, there’s no need to worry! We guarantee nationwide emergency delivery 24/7, 365 days a year no matter the weather. Find out more: https://bit.ly/3gikIWW', 'position': '16', 'datecreated': '2023-11-21T08:00:09.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-21T08:00:09.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1726873118424142179'}, {'identifier': '1724698786797080706', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Treat your equipment to fresh lubrication ahead of the winter! At Speedy Fuels, we have a vast range of industrial lubricants, greases and oils that we can deliver nationwide with fast delivery...', 'position': '17', 'datecreated': '2023-11-15T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-15T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1724698786797080706'}, {'identifier': '1721799685268996130', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'It’s international Stress Awareness Week and at Speedy Fuels we value the mental well-being of our staff which is why we’re a Health Assured member to provide our team with free mental...', 'position': '18', 'datecreated': '2023-11-07T08:00:09.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-11-07T08:00:09.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1721799685268996130'}, {'identifier': '1719262965885551043', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'We’d like to wish you all a Happy Halloween filled with lots of treats! 🍭🍫🎃', 'position': '19', 'datecreated': '2023-10-31T08:00:08.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-10-31T08:00:08.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1719262965885551043'}, {'identifier': '1718900582117949552', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Our fuel experts have all the tricks to prevent a fuel nightmare for your business this Halloween! You can discover all the treats that we provide on our services page using the link below....', 'position': '20', 'datecreated': '2023-10-30T08:00:09.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-10-30T08:00:09.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1718900582117949552'}, {'identifier': '1717435942573592810', 'commentcount': '0', 'articlebody': 'Is your fuel an asset or a liability? 78% of fuels that we test are contaminated which can be harmful to machinery and equipment. Get peace of mind today by booking a fuel test with us: https://bit...', 'position': '21', 'datecreated': '2023-10-26T07:00:11.000Z', 'datepublished': '2023-10-26T07:00:11.000Z', 'url': 'https://twitter.com/SpeedyFuels/status/1717435942573592810'}]}}, {'kind': 'customsearch#result', 'title': 'Renewable Fuel Supplier Approval', 'htmlTitle': 'Renewable <b>Fuel</b> Supplier Approval', 'link': 'https://cdn.speedyfuels.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Speedy-Fuels-RFS-Approval-Document-2025.pdf', 'displayLink': 'cdn.speedyfuels.co.uk', 'snippet': 'Jun 6, 2025 ... Speedy Fuels Ltd is approved under the Renewable Fuels Assurance Scheme, reference number SF/P10/21, to supply Renewable Diesel - HVO with\xa0...', 'htmlSnippet': 'Jun 6, 2025 <b>...</b> <b>Speedy Fuels</b> Ltd is approved un